# Ordered Jetpack/<Area>/Tests sources. Each file declares column-zero `#Test("plain name") { ... }` claims.
# check.sh --tests runs every claim on AOT (`jet test`) and on the default tier (`jet run`) through one
# generated driver, so both tiers prove the same bodies (I9). Test scope members are not used.
# Each area appends only under its own section header.

